      "cooked": "<p>I'm not sure I would consider that embarrassing. &nbsp; If La Capitan gets rolling I'm not sure there are a lot of times to counter her. &nbsp; Also, Viz is not neutered in this as you can at least determine the first card played and if you can keep the ship out of play then she can setup the one card La Capitan will play. &nbsp;</p>",
